    {
      "name": "log",
      "type": "Label",
      "visible": true,
      "enabled": false,
      "text": "Vex: The stone is older than the towers. Look closely and you can see three generations of repairs. We keep the old blocks because they still do the job.\nTorr: The city looks quiet from the hill. Down here, every cracked terminal has someone waiting on a spare part.\nYou: What is this slab used for?\nTorr: It used to match shifts with maintenance crews. Today we leave notes for each other. Ask around the hill before you trust a blank screen.\nLinn: Looking for someone? Try the shade. Sooner or later everyone comes up here, even the people who swear they are too busy.\nYou: Why does everyone meet here?\nLinn: You can see the gate, hear the market, and get out of the dust. No terminal needs to explain that. If we get separated, meet me on the hill.\nMira: Welcome to Basic General. Fresh seals on the flasks, checked packs in the medkits. I can buy that scrap coil if you need a few credits.\nYou: Show me your stock.\nMira: Bought Water Flask for 4 credits.\nMira: Sold Scrap Coil for 1 credit.\nLattice Jack: Signal acquired. Opening the sector lattice.\nLattice Jack: Link established to Crosswind Reach.\nRing Gate: Destination offline. The far ring has gone quiet.\nLattice Jack: Signal acquired. Opening the sector lattice.\nLattice Jack: Link established to Drywater Works.",
      "bounds": [
        42.0,
        515.0,
        368.0,
        501.0
      ],
      "fontSize": 18.0,
      "classes": [
        "unity-label",
        "unity-text-element"
      ],
      "hasBackground": false
